target/
.git/
docs/
deploy/
*.md
# Test and bench sources never build inside the image (the build stage
# compiles the two bins only), and keeping them out of the context is
# load-bearing for the layer cache: cargo-chef's recipe embeds the
# workspace's auto-discovered target list, so a new tests/*.rs file
# would otherwise change recipe.json and re-cook the entire release
# dependency graph (~8 min per platform) on a test-only change.
# NOTE: `tests/` alone matches only the repo-root directory — Docker
# ignore patterns don't recurse without `**`.
tests/
**/tests/
**/benches/
